 "〒": "بَرِيد (The postal service or system in general.) / بريد (To send by electronic mail.)  [mail]\nمثال: 強盗が郵便列車をめちゃくちゃにした。\n→ Robbers wrecked the mail train. / بَرِيد (The postal service or system in general.) / بريد (To send by electronic mail.)  [mail]",
 "あ": "[muteness ; speech impairment]",
 "あ〜": "[ah! ; oh!]\nocc. written as 嗚呼, 噫 or 嗟\nمثال: ああ悲しい。\n→ Ah, me! / بَلَى, مبلا (Used to indicate disagreement or dissent in reply to a negative statement.) / نَعَم, نَعَمَانِ (An affirmative expression; an answer that shows agreement or acceptance.)  [yes]\nمثال: 彼女に疲れているのかと聞かれて彼は「ああ」といった。\n→ He said \"Yeah\" when she asked if he was tired. / [aah ; gah]\nin exasperation\nمثال: ああ、また失敗した。\n→ Ah, I've failed again! / [hey! ; yo!]\nمثال: ああ飛行機が離陸する。\n→ Look! There's a plane taking off.",
