 "あげく": "بعد (Behind; later in time; following.) / خَلْفَ, وَرَاء (Behind.) / بَعْدَمَا (Signifies that the action of the clause it starts takes place before the action )  [after (a long process)]\nusu. after plain past verb, or as ...の～; also as ～に\nمثال: コンピューターを物色して歩いたあげく、デイヴィドより２００ドル安い値段で手に入れた。\n→ I shopped around for my computer and ended up paying $200 less than David. / [last line (of a renga)]",
