 "あさがた": "صَبَاح (part of the day between dawn and midday) / غُدْوة (part of the day between dawn and midday) / صُبْح (part of the day between dawn and midday) / صباح (part of the day between dawn and midday) / صُبُح (part of the day between dawn and midday) / صباح (part of the day between dawn and midday)  [morning (person)]\nمثال: あなたは朝型？\n→ Would you say you're a morning person?",
