 "あっと言わせる": "فَاجَأَ, بَاغَثَ (To excite by sudden alarm, surprise, or apprehension; to frighten suddenly and n)  [to startle]\nمثال: 彼は世間をあっといわせた。\n→ He took the public by surprise.",
