 "あっぱく": "ضَغْط (A pressing; a force applied to a surface.) / ضَغْط (The amount of force that is applied over a given area divided by the size of thi)  [pressure]\nمثال: その政府は国民を圧迫した。\n→ The government oppressed the people. / ظُلْم (The act of oppressing, or the state of being oppressed.)  [oppression]",
