 "あっぱらぱー": "مُرْتَاحُ اَلْبَالِ, خَالِي اَلْقَلْبِ (Without cares or worries; free of concern or worries; without difficulty.)  [carefree]",
 "あっぱれ": "مُحَمَّد (Meriting praise; worthy of high praise)  [praiseworthy]\nمثال: 「あっぱれ！」天使はそういうと、稲妻が走るもやもやの煙の中へ消えていった。\n→ \"Done!\" says the angel, and disappears in a cloud of smoke and a bolt of lightning. / [well done! ; bravo!]",
