 "あり": "نَمْل, نَمْلَة (Any of various insects in the family Formicidae in the order Hymenoptera, typica)  [ant]\nمثال: １匹のキリギリスと多くのアリが野原に住んでいた。\n→ A grasshopper and many ants lived in a field.",
 "ありあけ": "فَجْر (To begin to brighten with daylight.) / فَجْر, فَلَق (The morning twilight period immediately before sunrise.) / شُرُوق (The rising of the sun.) / شُرُوق, مَشْرِق (The time when the sun rises.) / فَجْر (The earliest phase of something.)  [dawn (esp. from the 16th day of the lunar month onward)] / [portable paper lantern for walking at night]",
 "ありうべからざる": "لَا يَخْطُرُ عَلَى الْبَالِ (That cannot be believed.) / لَا يَخْطُرُ عَلَى الْبَالِ (Inconceivable or unimaginable; extremely improbable in a way that goes against c)  [unthinkable] / [utterly unexpected ; totally unforeseen]",
 "ありうべき": "مُمْكِن (Able but not certain to happen; neither inevitable nor impossible.)  [possible]\nمثال: 警察はありうべき証拠を求めて家宅捜索した。\n→ The police searched her house for possible evidence. / مُفَضَّل, أَفْضَل (Better than some other option; preferred.)  [preferable]",
 "ありうる": "مُمْكِن (Able but not certain to happen; neither inevitable nor impossible.)  [possible]\nمثال: 勤勉さが経験不足を補うこともあり得る。\n→ Diligence may compensate for lack of experience.",
 "ありえない": "مُسْتَحِيل (Not possible; not able to be done or happen.) / مُسْتَحِيل (An impossibility.)  [impossible]\nمثال: それは決してありえない。\n→ That'll be a cold day in hell. / لَا يَخْطُرُ عَلَى الْبَالِ (That cannot be believed.) / لَا يَخْطُرُ عَلَى الْبَالِ (Inconceivable or unimaginable; extremely improbable in a way that goes against c)  [unthinkable]",
 "ありえないほど": "لا يصدق (Amazing, astonishing; so surprising that one is almost, or figuratively, unable )  [unbelievable (extent)]\nمثال: 競馬で稼ぐ！ありえないほど儲かる競馬ノウハウ集！\n→ Earn money on the races! Know-how collection on horse racing will have you raking it in!",
