 "ありかた": "[the way (something) ought to be] / وَضْع (A condition; a set of circumstances applying at any given time.) / دَوْلَة (A polity or community.) / وِلَايَة (A polity or community.) / يُبْدِي (To make known.)  [(present) state (of)]",
 "ありがじゅっぴき": "شُكْرًا, شُكْرًا (An expression of gratitude or politeness in response to something done or given.)  [thank you]",
