 "ある": "كَانَ (As a copulative verb:) / كَانَ هُوَ, هِيَ (As a copulative verb:) / كَانَ (As an intransitive lexical verb:)  [to be]\nusu. of inanimate objects\nمثال: 失礼だが、上記の記事にある３つの誤りを指摘しておきたい。\n→ Excuse me; allow me to point out three errors in the above article. / مَلَكَ, اِمْتَلَكَ (To possess, own.) / تَنَاوَلَ (To consume or use up (a particular substance or resource, especially food or dri)  [to have]\nمثال: 悪いけどほかに用事があるの。\n→ I'm sorry, I have another engagement. / [to be located] / [to be equipped with]",
