 "いいたす": "جَمَعَ (To sum up; to put together mentally; to add up.) / أَضَافَ (To append (e.g. a statement); to say further information.) / أَضَافَ (To intensify; to augment; to increase.) / أَضَافَ (To add someone as a friend.)  [to add (to what was said before)]\nمثال: 「急ぐな」と彼は言いたした。\n→ \"Don't hurry,\" he added.",
