 "いおり": "تَرَاجُع (act of pulling back or withdrawing) / اِنْسِحَاب (act of pulling back or withdrawing) / تَرَاجَعَ (To withdraw from a position, go back.)  [retreat]",
 "いか": "[not exceeding ... ; not more than ...]\nمثال: １６歳以下の子供は劇場には入場できません。\n→ Children of age sixteen and under will not be admitted to the theatre. / تَحْتَ (Lower in spatial position than.) / جَنُوبِيّ (South of.)  [below (a standard, level, etc.)]\nمثال: 君の要約は平均以下だね。\n→ Your summary is not up to par. / تَالٍ, التَّالِي (Coming next, either in sequence or in time.) / بَعْد (After, subsequent to.)  [the following]\nمثال: 以下の説明は多くの異なる理論を比較的対照することによって得られたものである。\n→ The explanation below was achieved by comparing and contrasting a variety of different theories. / [including ... ; ... and other (employees, officials, etc.)]\nused to refer to all members of a group, starting with the head or principal figure",
