 "いかす": "[to make (the best) use of ; to put to good use]\nمثال: 彼はわずかな収入を精一杯活かした。\n→ He made the best of his small income. / [to let live ; to keep alive]\nمثال: 自分も生き、他人も生かせ。\n→ Live and let live. / أَحْيَا (transitive: to bring back to life)  [to revive]\nمثال: 心停止の患者を応急処置で生かした。\n→ We used emergency measures to revive the cardiac arrest patient. / اِسْتَعَادَ (to bring back to a previous condition or state)  [to restore (a deleted passage; in proofreading)]",
