 "いかずちぐも": "سَحَاب رَاعِد, سَحَابَة رَاعِدَة (A large, dark cloud, usually a cumulonimbus, charged with electricity and produc)  [thundercloud]\nمثال: 雷雲が谷一面にたれこめていた。\n→ The storm-clouds brooded over the valley.",
