 "いかづち": "بَرْق (A flash of light produced by short-duration, high-voltage discharge of electrici) / بَرْق (A discharge of this kind.) / بَرَقَ, أَبْرَقَ (To produce lightning.)  [lightning]",
 "いかで": "كَيْف, ازاي (In what manner) / كَيْفَ, ازاي (In what manner:) / كَيْفَ, ازاي (In what state or condition.) / كَمْ, يَا لَ (Used as a modifier to indicate surprise, delight, or other strong feelings in an)  [how]",
 "いかな": "[what kind of ; whatever sort of] / مَهْمَا (Regardless of, in spite of, whatever.)  [no matter what]\nمثال: おやおや。いかな体育の授業といえど・・・真剣勝負の意気込みで臨まなければ、いざ実戦と言う時に役に立ちませんよ。\n→ Well, even if it is just P.E. class, if you don't take it seriously, it won't do you any good in a real match.",
