 "いかなる": "يَا لَ (Emphasises that something is noteworthy or remarkable in quality or degree, in e) / مَا (That which; those that; the thing(s) that.) / مَاذَا, مَا (Anything that; all that; whatever.)  [what]\nمثال: いかなる動物も、植物なしでは生存できない。\n→ No animal can exist without plants. / مَهْمَا (Regardless of, in spite of, whatever.)  [no matter what (kind of)]\nas いかなる...でも, いかなる...も, etc.",
