 "いかに": "كَيْف, ازاي (In what manner) / كَيْفَ, ازاي (In what manner:) / كَيْفَ, ازاي (In what state or condition.) / كَمْ, يَا لَ (Used as a modifier to indicate surprise, delight, or other strong feelings in an)  [how]\nمثال: 環境汚染にいかに取り組むかは深刻な問題である。\n→ How to deal with environmental pollution is a serious matter. / كَيْف, ازاي (In what manner) / كَيْفَ, ازاي (In what manner:) / كَيْفَ, ازاي (In what state or condition.) / كَمْ, يَا لَ (Used as a modifier to indicate surprise, delight, or other strong feelings in an)  [how (much)]\nمثال: 私は教育がいかに重要であるかを痛感しました。\n→ It was brought home to me how important education is. / بِأَيَّةِ طَرِيقَة, عَلَى كُلِّ حَال (In any way that one likes or chooses; in a haphazard or spontaneous way.)  [however (much)]\nas いかに...も\nمثال: 施設は、その使命がいかに崇高なものでも、家庭のかわりにはなり得なかった。\n→ Institutions, however noble their missions, have failed to replace the family. / يَاه, اسمع (An exclamation to get attention.) / هَلَا (An informal greeting, similar to hi.)  [hey]",
 "いかにして": "كَيْف, ازاي (In what manner) / كَيْفَ, ازاي (In what manner:) / كَيْفَ, ازاي (In what state or condition.) / كَمْ, يَا لَ (Used as a modifier to indicate surprise, delight, or other strong feelings in an)  [how]\nمثال: 君の成功は主に好機をいかにして上手に利用するかにかかっている。\n→ Your success will largely depend upon how you will make good use of your opportunity.",
 "いかにも": "حَقًّا (Actually; in fact; in reality.) / وَٱللّٰه؟ (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some ) / لَيْسَ مَعْقُل! (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some ) / حَقًّا (indicating surprise at, or requesting confirmation of, some )  [really]\nindicating emotive conviction\nمثال: こんな格好をしているといかにもスポーツしてそうに見えるけど、全然やってないんだよ。\n→ I look for all the world like an athlete in this outfit, but the truth is I don't do any sports at all. / جِدًّا (To a great extent or degree.)  [very] / مطلقا, على الإطلاق (In an absolute or unconditional manner; utterly, positively, wholly.)  [absolutely]\nindicating agreement",
