 "いきあたりばったり": "عَشْوَائِيّ (Occurring for no particular reason; haphazard, unpredictable.) / عَشْوَائِيّ (Involving an outcome which is impossible to predict, but which may be represente)  [random]\nمثال: 行き当たりばったりの仕事をするな。\n→ Don't leave everything to chance.",
