 "いきずり": "مَرَّرَ, مَرَّ (To change place.) / اِحْتَازَ (To change in state or status) / اِنْقَضَى, مَرَّ (To move through time.) / أَهمَلَ (To move through time.) / تَغَاضَى (To be accepted.) / تَخَلَّى (To refrain from doing something.) / طَريق (An opening, road, or track, available for passing; especially, one through or ov) / جَوَاز (Permission or license to pass, or to go and come.) / جَوَاز (A document granting permission to pass or to go and come; a passport; a ticket p)  [passing]\nمثال: あの人は行きずりの人です。\n→ He is only a passing chance acquaintance. / [(place) that one happens to pass by] / مُؤَقَّت, سَريع الزوال (Passing or disappearing with time; transitory.)  [transient]",
