 "いきよい": "قُوَّة (Ability to influence; strength or energy of body or mind; active power; vigour; ) / قُوَّة (Anything that is able to make a substantial change in a person or thing.) / أَجْبَرَ, اِضْطَرَّ (To compel (an adversary or partner) to trump a trick by leading a suit that he/s)  [force]\nمثال: あらしの勢いが弱まった。\n→ The storm abated. / نَفُوذ, تَأْثِير (The power to affect, control or manipulate something or someone; the ability to ) / تَأْثِير (An action exerted by a person or thing with such power on another to cause chang) / أَثَّرَ (To have an effect on by using gentle or subtle action; to exert an influence upo)  [influence] / زَخَم حَرَكَة (Of a body in motion: the tendency of a body to maintain its inertial motion; the) / زَخَم (The impetus, either of a body in motion, or of an idea or course of events; a mo)  [momentum]\nمثال: 勢いに流されているんですよ。\n→ You are carried along with the slide. / حَتْماً, بِالضَّرُورَة (Inevitably; of necessity.)  [necessarily]",
 "いきる": "حَيِيَ, عَاشَ (To be alive; to have life.) / يَنْجُو (To survive; to persevere; to continue.) / حَيّ (Having life; that is alive.) / مُباشِر (Being broadcast (“on the air”), as it happens.)  [to live] / اِرْتَزَقَ (To earn enough income to support oneself and, if applicable, one's family.)  [to make a living] / وَظِيفَة (What something does or is used for.) / مَهَمَّة (A professional or official position.) / دَالَّة, تَابِع (A relation in which each element of the domain is associated with exactly one el) / وَظِيفَة, دَالَّة (A routine that receives zero or more arguments and may return a result.)  [to function]\nمثال: この本はまだ版権が生きている。\n→ This book is still copyrighted. / [to come to life ; to be enlivened]",
 "いきるみち": "حَيَاة, طَرِيقَة فِي حَيَاة (A style of living that reflects the attitudes of a person or group.)  [way of life]",
 "いきわたる": "يسود (To be superior in strength, dominance, influence, or frequency; to have or gain )  [to prevail]\nمثال: この雑誌は広く行き渡っている。\n→ This magazine circulates widely.",
 "いきをする": "تَنَفَّسَ (To draw air into (inhale), and expel air from (exhale), the lungs in order to ex)  [to breathe]\nمثال: 鼻で息をしていてください。\n→ Please breathe through your nose.",
 "いきをはく": "زَفَرَ (To expel air from the lungs through the nose or mouth by action of the diaphragm)  [to exhale]\nمثال: 寒い天気に息を吐くと、息が見える。\n→ When you breathe out in cold weather, you can see your breath.",
 "いきをひきとる": "مَاتَ (to stop living) / تُوُفِّيَ (to stop living) / زَهْر اَلطَّاوِلَة, زَهْر اَلنَّرْد (An isohedral polyhedron, usually a cube, with numbers or symbols on each side an)  [to die]\nمثال: 彼は息をひきとった。\n→ He breathed his last.",
 "いき値": "عَتَبَة (The lowermost part of a doorway that one crosses to enter; a sill.) / بِدَايَة (The outset of something; the point of entry, or the beginning of an action.)  [threshold (amount, dose, etc.)]",
 "いぎ": "كَرَامَة, وَقَار (The state of being dignified or worthy of esteem: elevation of mind or character)  [dignity]",
 "いぎのもうしたて": "اِعْتَرَضَ, اِحْتَجَّ (To make a strong objection.) / اِعْتِرَاض, اِحْتِجَاج (A formal objection, especially one by a group.)  [protest]",
 "いぎぶかい": "هَامّ (Having a noticeable or major effect.)  [significant]\nمثال: 結婚式は、意義深い儀式である。\n→ A wedding is a significant ceremony.",
