 "いくさ": "حَرْب (conflict involving organized use of arms) / مُحَارَبَة (conflict involving organized use of arms) / حرب (conflict involving organized use of arms) / حرب (conflict involving organized use of arms) / حَرْب (conflict involving organized use of arms) / حَارَبَ, شَنَّ حَرْبًا (To engage in conflict (may be followed by \"with\" to specify the foe).)  [war]\nمثال: 腹が減っては戦ができぬ。\n→ An army travels on its stomach. / قُوَّات, عَسْكَرِيَّة (Military personnel in uniform.)  [troops]",
