 "いくさき": "وِجْهَة, وُجْهَة (The place set for the end of a journey or to which something is sent; place or p)  [destination] / [whereabouts] / مُسْتَقْبَل (The time ahead; those moments yet to be experienced.) / مُسْتَقْبَلِيّ, مُسْتَقْبَل (Having to do with or occurring in the future.)  [future]",
