 "いくら": "كَمْ (What amount or quantity of (something stated or implied).)  [how much]\nمثال: 入場料はいくらですか。\n→ How much is the entrance fee? / [something over ; and something]\nafter a rounded number, esp. a sum of money / بِأَيَّةِ طَرِيقَة, عَلَى كُلِّ حَال (In any way that one likes or chooses; in a haphazard or spontaneous way.)  [however (much)]\nas いくら...〜ても, いくら...〜でも, etc.\nمثال: 私がいくら言っても、聞こうとしないのよ。\n→ You never listen, no matter how many times I tell you.",
 "いくらか": "بَعْضٌ (A certain number (multiple but not all).) / بَعْض (An indefinite quantity.) / بَعْض (An indefinite amount; a part. Used mostly with abstract and nonliving objects.) / بَعْضٌ (A nonzero, unspecified proportion of (a bounded set of countable things): at lea)  [some]\nمثال: 彼女は非常の場合に備えていくらか貯金した。\n→ She put by some money for a rainy day. / [somewhat ; to some extent]\nمثال: クリスマスが近づくにつれて景気はいくらか回復した。\n→ With the approach of Christmas, business improved somewhat.",
 "いくらでも": "[as many as one likes ; as much as one likes]\nمثال: 好きな花をいくらでも選びなさい。\n→ Choose any flowers you like. / كَثِير (A more-than-adequate amount; plenitude; a great deal.)  [plenty]\nمثال: 彼はいくらでもお金を出せる。\n→ He can come up with any amount of money. / تَقْرِيبًا, عَلَى وَشْك (Very close to, but not quite.)  [almost (none)]\nas いくらでもない / [no matter how much ; no matter how big or small]",
