 "いけがき": "وَشِيع, سِيَاج نَبَاتِيّ (A thicket of bushes or other shrubbery, especially one planted as a fence betwee)  [hedge]\nمثال: 猫は生け垣を通り抜けた。\n→ The cat got through the hedge.",
 "いけこむ": "رَتَّبَ (To set up; to organize; to put into an orderly sequence or arrangement.)  [to arrange (e.g. flowers)]",
