 "いけんこうかん": "عَصَف ذِهْنِيّ, قَدَح ذِهْنِيّ (A method of problem solving in which members of a group contribute ideas spontan)  [brainstorming]\nمثال: 彼女はガードレールの強度について、ぜひ意見交換をしたいと望んでいます。\n→ She would value the opportunity to exchange views on the strength of guard-rails.",
