 "いけんをのべる": "رَأَى, ظَنَّ (To express an opinion; to state as an opinion; to suppose, consider (that).)  [to opine]\nمثال: 私は率直に意見を述べる人を尊敬します。\n→ I admire a person who expresses a frank opinion.",
