 "いずれ": "أَيّ (What, of those mentioned or implied.) / مَما (Designates the one(s) previously mentioned.) / أَيّ (What one or ones (of those mentioned or implied).) / اَلَّذِي (In a non-restrictive relative clause, referring to something previously mentione)  [which]\nمثال: 作家としての彼女は伝統的なカテゴリーのいずれにも当てはまらない。\n→ As a writer, she does not fit into any of the traditional categories. / كُلّ, جَمِيع (Every individual or anything of the given class, with no exceptions (the noun or) / كُلّ, جَمِيع (Wholly; entirely; completely; totally.) / جَمِيع (Everything that one is capable of.)  [all]\nas いずれも or いずれの...も / عَلَى كُلِّ حَال, على كل حال (Regardless; anyhow.) / عَلَى أَيُّ حَالٍ, على كل حال (Used to indicate that a statement explains or supports a previous statement. See)  [anyway] / عَاجِلاً أَم آجِلاً, عَاجِلاً أَو آجِلاً (Eventually, at some undetermined time in the not-too-distant future.)  [sooner or later]\nمثال: いずれどこかに落ち着いて身を固めるつもりだが、まだまだだ。\n→ Eventually I'd like to settle down and have a family, but not yet.",
 "いずれか": "وَاحِد, وَاحِدَة (The number represented by the Arabic numeral 1; the numerical value equal to tha) / اَلْمَرْء (Any person (applying to people in general).)  [one (of)]\nمثال: 選ぶべき道はただ１つ成功か死かのいずれか。\n→ The only alternatives are success and death.",
 "いずれにしても": "عَلَى أَيِّ حَالٍ (Whatever be the case.)  [in any case]\nمثال: チャンスというものはいずれにしても、まれにしかない。\n→ Chances come rarely in any case.",
 "いずれにしろ": "عَلَى أَيِّ حَالٍ (Whatever be the case.)  [in any case]\nمثال: いずれにしろ、明日は列車に乗りなさい。\n→ In any case, catch the train tomorrow.",
 "いずれにせよ": "عَلَى كُلِّ حَال, على كل حال (Regardless; anyhow.) / عَلَى أَيُّ حَالٍ, على كل حال (Used to indicate that a statement explains or supports a previous statement. See)  [anyway]\nمثال: いずれにせよ、その隔たりは現実のものであり、実際に役に立つものではあるのだが、同時にそれは誤解を招くおそれのあるものでもある。\n→ In either case, the division is real and useful; but it can also be misleading.",
 "いずれは": "أَخِيرًا, فِي اَلْآخِرْ (In the end; at some later time, especially after a long time, a series of proble)  [eventually]\nمثال: 君の努力はいずれは報われることだろう。\n→ Your efforts will be rewarded in the long run.",
 "いずれも": "أَيّ (One at all; at least one; at least one kind of; some; a positive quantity of.) / أَيّ (A/an, each or some, no matter its/their identity or nature.) / أَيّ, كُلّ (Any thing(s) or person(s).)  [any]\nمثال: その本はどれも読んでない。\n→ I have not read all the books.",
 "いせい": "قُوَّة, قُدْرَة (The ability to coerce, influence, or control.) / قُوَّة (The ability to coerce, influence, or control.) / قُوَّة, طَاقَة (Strength, energy.) / طَاقَة كَهْرَبَائِيَّة, طَاقَة (Strength, energy.) / قُوَّة (A product of equal factors (and generalizations of this notion): xⁿ, read as \"x )  [power]\nمثال: 彼、今のところは飛ぶ鳥も落とす勢いだけれど、あの威勢いつまでもつのか、疑問だね。\n→ He's unstoppable right now but the question is how long he can remain at the pinnacle of his career. / كُحُول, خَمْر (Distilled alcoholic beverages.)  [spirits]",
