 "いせん": "مُوَازٍ (Having the same overall direction; the comparison is indicated with \"to\".) / مُتَوَازٍ (Either not intersecting, or coinciding.) / مُتَوَازٍ (Involving the processing of multiple tasks at the same time.)  [parallel]",
