 "いっさい": "كُلّ, جَمِيع (Every individual or anything of the given class, with no exceptions (the noun or) / كُلّ, جَمِيع (Wholly; entirely; completely; totally.) / جَمِيع (Everything that one is capable of.)  [all]\nمثال: それは他のいっさいに勝っている。\n→ It is paramount to all the others. / مطلقا, على الإطلاق (In an absolute or unconditional manner; utterly, positively, wholly.)  [absolutely (not)]\nwith neg. verb",
