 "いっさんかたんそ": "أَوَّل أُكْسِيد اَلْكَرْبُون (A colorless, odorless, flammable, highly toxic gas.)  [carbon monoxide]\nمثال: 一酸化炭素とは炭素化合物の不完全燃焼で発生する有害物質です。\n→ Carbon monoxide is a poisonous substance formed by the incomplete combustion of carbon compounds.",
