 "いっしき": "وَضَع (To put (something) down, to rest.) / غَرَبَ (Of a heavenly body, to disappear below the horizon of a planet, etc, as the latt) / مَجْمُوعَة, طَقْم (A matching collection of similar things. (Note the similar meaning in Etymology ) / مَجْمُوعَة (Set theory.)  [(complete) set]\nمثال: 用具を一式貸してください。\n→ Lend me a tool set please. / كُلّ, جَمِيع (Every individual or anything of the given class, with no exceptions (the noun or) / كُلّ, جَمِيع (Wholly; entirely; completely; totally.) / جَمِيع (Everything that one is capable of.)  [all]",
 "いっしつ": "خَسَارَة, فِقْدَان (The result of no longer possessing an object, a function, or a characteristic du) / ضَرَر (The destruction or ruin of an object.) / خَسَارَة (The death of a person or animal.)  [a loss]",
 "いっしゅ": "نوع (type, race, category) / حَنُون, لَطِيف (Affectionate.)  [a kind]\nمثال: イルカは哺乳類の一種です。\n→ A dolphin is a kind of mammal. / [of sorts ; something of a]\nas 一種の...\nمثال: 怒りを抑えることは一種の美徳である。\n→ It's a kind of virtue to keep one's temper. / [sort of ; somewhat]",
