 "いっしゅうき": "نُقْطَة, عَلَامَة فَصْلِيَّة (The punctuation mark “.” (indicating the ending of a sentence or marking an abbr) / حِصَّةٌ (Each of the divisions into which a school day is split, allocated to a given sub) / عَصْر (A geochronologic unit of millions to tens of millions of years; a subdivision of)  [period]",
