 "いっしょに": "مَعًا, سَوِيًّا (At the same time, in the same place; in close association or proximity.)  [together (with)] / فِي نَفْس اَلْوَقْت (Overlapping or coinciding in duration.)  [at the same time] / [in one lump ; in the same category]",
