 "いつくしみ": "حَبِيب, حَبِيبَة (A person who is the object of romantic feelings; a darling, a sweetheart, a belo) / أَحَبَّ, حب (To have a strong affection for (someone or something).) / أَحَبَّ (To be strongly inclined towards something; an emphatic form of like.)  [love]",
 "いつくしむ": "حَبِيب, حَبِيبَة (A person who is the object of romantic feelings; a darling, a sweetheart, a belo) / أَحَبَّ, حب (To have a strong affection for (someone or something).) / أَحَبَّ (To be strongly inclined towards something; an emphatic form of like.)  [to love]\nمثال: 死がまさに我らを引離すまで愛し、いつくしむ。\n→ To love and to cherish, till death do us part.",
 "いつげん": "مُبَالَغَة (The act of exaggerating; the act of doing or representing in an excessive manner)  [exaggeration]",
