 "いづ": "تَرَكَ (To have a consequence or remnant.) / تَرَكَ, غَادَرَ (To depart; to separate from.) / إِجَازَة, عُطْلَة (Permission to be absent; time away from one's work.)  [to leave] / تَرَكَ (To have a consequence or remnant.) / تَرَكَ, غَادَرَ (To depart; to separate from.) / إِجَازَة, عُطْلَة (Permission to be absent; time away from one's work.)  [to leave (on a journey)] / [to move forward] / بَلَغَ (To extend, stretch, or thrust out (for example a limb or object held in the hand)  [to reach]",
 "いづこ": "أَيْن, فين (In, at or to what place.) / حَيْثُ (The place in, at or to which.) / أَيْن (The place in which something happens.)  [where]\nمثال: あなたはどこでテレビを見ますか。\n→ Where do you watch television? / كَمْ (What amount or quantity of (something stated or implied).)  [how much (long, far)]",
 "いづれ": "أَيّ (What, of those mentioned or implied.) / مَما (Designates the one(s) previously mentioned.) / أَيّ (What one or ones (of those mentioned or implied).) / اَلَّذِي (In a non-restrictive relative clause, referring to something previously mentione)  [which]\nمثال: 作家としての彼女は伝統的なカテゴリーのいずれにも当てはまらない。\n→ As a writer, she does not fit into any of the traditional categories. / كُلّ, جَمِيع (Every individual or anything of the given class, with no exceptions (the noun or) / كُلّ, جَمِيع (Wholly; entirely; completely; totally.) / جَمِيع (Everything that one is capable of.)  [all]\nas いずれも or いずれの...も / عَلَى كُلِّ حَال, على كل حال (Regardless; anyhow.) / عَلَى أَيُّ حَالٍ, على كل حال (Used to indicate that a statement explains or supports a previous statement. See)  [anyway] / عَاجِلاً أَم آجِلاً, عَاجِلاً أَو آجِلاً (Eventually, at some undetermined time in the not-too-distant future.)  [sooner or later]\nمثال: いずれどこかに落ち着いて身を固めるつもりだが、まだまだだ。\n→ Eventually I'd like to settle down and have a family, but not yet.",
