 "いてこます": "هُجُوم m هَجْمَة (attempt to cause damage, injury, or death) / حَمْلَة (attempt to cause damage, injury, or death) / هَاجَمَ (To apply violent force to someone or something.)  [to attack]",
 "いてざ": "بُرْج اَلْقَوْس, اَلْقَوْس (A constellation of the zodiac traditionally figured as a centaur drawing a bow. ) / بُرْج اَلْقَوْس, اَلْقَوْس (The zodiac sign for the archer, ruled by Jupiter and covering November 23 - Dece)  [Sagittarius (constellation)]",
 "いてつく": "تَجَمَّدَ (Especially of a liquid, to become solid due to low temperature.)  [to freeze]\nمثال: 車が凍てついた路面を滑った時は「ひやっ」とした。\n→ It was frightful when my car skidded on the ice.",
 "いてまう": "نَبْض (A pulsation or throb.) / ضَرَبَ, دَقَّ (To hit; to strike.) / وَجَفَ (To strike or pound repeatedly, usually in some sort of rhythm.) / هَزَمَ, غَلَبَ (To win against; to defeat or overcome; to do or be better than (someone); to exc) / خَفَقَ (To mix food in a rapid fashion. Compare whip.)  [to beat]",
 "いてる": "تَجَمَّدَ (Especially of a liquid, to become solid due to low temperature.)  [to freeze]",
 "いてん": "مُتَحَرِّك (That moves or move.) / مُؤَثِّر (Causing or evoking deep emotions.)  [moving]\nمثال: ４月１日、南洋フーズ株式会社は横浜の新社屋に移転します。\n→ On April 1, Nanyo Foods Co. Ltd. will move to its new building in Yokohama. / حَوَّلَ (To move or pass from one place, person or thing to another.) / اِنْتِقَال (act)  [transfer (of deeds, property, etc.)]",
 "いて座": "بُرْج اَلْقَوْس, اَلْقَوْس (A constellation of the zodiac traditionally figured as a centaur drawing a bow. ) / بُرْج اَلْقَوْس, اَلْقَوْس (The zodiac sign for the archer, ruled by Jupiter and covering November 23 - Dece)  [Sagittarius (constellation)]",
 "いで": "حَسَنًا, بِخَيْر (Accurately, competently, satisfactorily.) / حَسَنًا, بِخَيْر (Completely, fully.) / حَسَنًا, بِخَيْر (To a significant degree.) / بِخَيْر (In good health.) / طيّب (used to introduce a statement that may be contrary to expect) / حسنًا (used to introduce a statement that may be contrary to expect) / بِئْر, بير (A hole sunk into the ground as a source of water, oil, natural gas or other flui) / عَيْن, بِئْر (A place where a liquid such as water surfaces naturally; a spring.)  [well]",
 "いでたち": "لَبِسَ (intransitive: to put on clothes — see also get dressed, wear) / ثَوْب, لِبَاس (An item of clothing (usually worn by a woman or young girl) which both covers th) / كَسْوَة, مَلْبَس (Apparel or clothing, especially when appropriate for a particular occasion, prof)  [dress]\nمثال: 出で立ちが何となく貴族っぽいような気がする。\n→ His dress somehow gives an aristocratic impression.",
 "いでたつ": "نَجْمَة, اِبْتِدَاء (The beginning of an activity.) / نَجْمَة (The beginning point of a race, a board game, etc.) / بَدَأَ (To begin, commence, initiate.)  [to start]",
 "いでや": "حَسَنًا, بِخَيْر (Accurately, competently, satisfactorily.) / حَسَنًا, بِخَيْر (Completely, fully.) / حَسَنًا, بِخَيْر (To a significant degree.) / بِخَيْر (In good health.) / طيّب (used to introduce a statement that may be contrary to expect) / حسنًا (used to introduce a statement that may be contrary to expect) / بِئْر, بير (A hole sunk into the ground as a source of water, oil, natural gas or other flui) / عَيْن, بِئْر (A place where a liquid such as water surfaces naturally; a spring.)  [well]",
 "いでゆ": "يُنْبُوع حَارّ, مِيَاه حارَّة (A natural spring producing water whose temperature is greater than about 20 °C ()  [hot spring]",
