 "いでん": "مِيرَاث, إرْثْ (That which a person is entitled to inherit, by law or testament, such as the par)  [(genetic) inheritance]\nمثال: この犯罪者は遺伝の犠牲者だ。\n→ This criminal is a victim of his heredity.",
