 "いとおしい": "عَزِيز, عَزِيْزَة (Loved; lovable.) / غَالِي, غَالِيَّة (Precious to or greatly valued by someone.)  [dear]\nمثال: なんでも自分で手がけると、いとおしくなるものです。\n→ Whatever it is, you become fonder of it if you work on it yourself. / فَقِير (With no or few possessions or money, particularly in relation to contemporaries ) / مِسْكِين (Worthy of pity.) / فُقَرَاء (The poor people of a society or the world collectively, the poor class of a soci)  [poor]",
 "いとおしがる": "شَفَقَة (A feeling of sympathy at the misfortune or suffering of someone or something.) / شَفِقَ (To feel pity for (someone or something).)  [to pity]",
 "いとおしむ": "حَبِيب, حَبِيبَة (A person who is the object of romantic feelings; a darling, a sweetheart, a belo) / أَحَبَّ, حب (To have a strong affection for (someone or something).) / أَحَبَّ (To be strongly inclined towards something; an emphatic form of like.)  [to love]",
