 "いも": "قُلْقَاس (Colocasia esculenta, raised as a food primarily for its corm, which distantly re) / قُلْقَاس (Food from a taro plant.)  [taro]\nمثال: いもを食べるとおならがでる。\n→ Potatoes give me wind. / [yokel ; bumpkin] / [dud ; worthless thing]",
