 "いもぎみ": "أخت (Any woman or girl with whom a bond is felt through the same biological sex, gend)  [(younger) sister]",
 "いもしない": "غَيْر مَرْئِيّ, خَفِيّ (Unable to be seen; out of sight; not visible.)  [invisible]\nemphatic form of 居ない / غَامِض (Of unknown origin.)  [mysterious] / خِيَّالِيّ (Existing only in the imagination.)  [imaginary]",
 "いもじ": "مُؤَسِّس, مُؤَسِّسَة (One who founds or establishes (a company, project, organisation, state, etc.).)  [founder]",
