 "いもづる式": "وَاحِدًا تِلْوَ الآخَرِ (In single file.)  [(appearing, occurring) one after another]\nusu. adverbially as 〜に",
 "いもの": "طَبَقَة, طَبَقِيَّة (Any of the hereditary social classes and subclasses of South Asian societies or )  [casting]\nمثال: 鋳物が金型からすっぽりとれた。\n→ The casting came cleanly out of its mold.",
