 "いもむし": "يَرَقَة, دُودَة الْفَرَاشَة (The larva of a butterfly or moth; leafworm.)  [(hairless) caterpillar]\nمثال: この芋虫がきれいな蝶になるのだ。\n→ This caterpillar will become a beautiful butterfly.",
