 "いやくひん": "مُخَدِّر (A psychoactive substance, especially one which is illegal and addictive, ingeste) / عَقَّار (Any commodity that lies on hand, or is not salable; an article of slow sale, or )  [drugs]\nمثال: ボランティアグループの人達は戦争被害者に食料と医薬品を配っている。\n→ The volunteer group provides war victims with food and medicine.",
 "いやけ": "كَرِهَ (To have a feeling of aversion or antipathy towards; not to like.)  [dislike]",
 "いやごと": "[words of gratitude] / أُسْلُوب, طَرِيقَة (Mode of action; way of performing or doing anything.)  [manners]",
