 "うつりかわり": "تَغَيَّرَƒ (To become something different.) / غَيَّرَ (To make something into something else.) / تَغْيِير, تَبْدِيل (The process or result of becoming different.) / فَكَّة (Small denominations of money given in exchange for a larger denomination.) / بَاقٍ (Balance of money returned from the sum paid after deducting the price of a purch) / تَغْيِير (A transfer between vehicles.)  [change (e.g. season)]\nمثال: 青年期は移り変わりの時期と見られている。\n→ Adolescence is viewed as time of transition.",
 "うつりかわる": "تَغَيَّرَƒ (To become something different.) / غَيَّرَ (To make something into something else.) / تَغْيِير, تَبْدِيل (The process or result of becoming different.) / فَكَّة (Small denominations of money given in exchange for a larger denomination.) / بَاقٍ (Balance of money returned from the sum paid after deducting the price of a purch) / تَغْيِير (A transfer between vehicles.)  [to change (with time, the ages, the seasons, etc.)]",
 "うつりぎ": "مُتَقَلِّب (Impulsive and unpredictable; determined by chance, impulse, or whim.)  [capricious]\nمثال: 彼女の移り気にはみんな当惑している。\n→ We are all bewildered by her inconstancy.",
