 "うつりすむ": "حَرُكَ, تَحَرَّكَ (To change place or posture; to go, in any manner, from one place or position to ) / اِنْتَقَلَ, تَحَلْحَلَ (To change residence, for example from one house, town, or state, to another; to )  [to move (to another area, country, etc.)]\nمثال: カールがドイツに移り住むと聞いた時には驚いた。\n→ It took me by surprise to hear that Carl was moving to Germany.",
 "うつりゆく": "تَغَيَّرَƒ (To become something different.) / غَيَّرَ (To make something into something else.) / تَغْيِير, تَبْدِيل (The process or result of becoming different.) / فَكَّة (Small denominations of money given in exchange for a larger denomination.) / بَاقٍ (Balance of money returned from the sum paid after deducting the price of a purch) / تَغْيِير (A transfer between vehicles.)  [to change]",
 "うつりん": "[dense forest ; thick forest] / اِسْتَطَاعَ (To have permission to, be allowed. Used in granting permission and in questions )  [May]",
 "うつる": "حَرُكَ, تَحَرَّكَ (To change place or posture; to go, in any manner, from one place or position to ) / اِنْتَقَلَ, تَحَلْحَلَ (To change residence, for example from one house, town, or state, to another; to )  [to move (to another place or state)]\nocc. used transitively\nمثال: ハイジャック犯達は飛行機の後部に移った。\n→ The hijackers moved to the rear of the plane. / نَشَرَ (To disperse, to scatter or distribute over a given area.) / نَشَرَ (To disseminate; to cause to proliferate, to make (something) widely known or pre) / اِنْتِشَار (The act of spreading.)  [to spread (of a fire, smell, etc.)]\nocc. written 伝染る or 感染る in ref. to infection\nمثال: 枝葉末節の議論はもうそろそろ止めにして、本筋の話に移りませんか。\n→ Why don't we stop arguing over these piddling matters and get to the issues at hand? / حَرُكَ, تَحَرَّكَ (To change place or posture; to go, in any manner, from one place or position to ) / اِنْتَقَلَ, تَحَلْحَلَ (To change residence, for example from one house, town, or state, to another; to )  [to move (e.g. of one's focus)] / [to be permeated (by a color or scent) ; to seep into]",
 "うつろ": "تَجْوِيف (A hole or hollow depression in a solid object.)  [cavity]\nمثال: 洞窟からうつろに反響する音を耳にした。\n→ We heard somber hollow sounds from the cave. / أَجْوَف (Having an empty space or cavity inside.)  [hollow (voice, smile, etc.)]",
 "うつろい": "تَغَيَّرَƒ (To become something different.) / غَيَّرَ (To make something into something else.) / تَغْيِير, تَبْدِيل (The process or result of becoming different.) / فَكَّة (Small denominations of money given in exchange for a larger denomination.) / بَاقٍ (Balance of money returned from the sum paid after deducting the price of a purch) / تَغْيِير (A transfer between vehicles.)  [change]\nمثال: 靜子が季節の移ろいを詩に綴りました。\n→ Shizuko composed a poem about the change of the seasons. / تَقْلِيعَة (A phenomenon that becomes popular for a very short time.)  [fading]",
 "うつろう": "تَغَيَّرَƒ (To become something different.) / غَيَّرَ (To make something into something else.) / تَغْيِير, تَبْدِيل (The process or result of becoming different.) / فَكَّة (Small denominations of money given in exchange for a larger denomination.) / بَاقٍ (Balance of money returned from the sum paid after deducting the price of a purch) / تَغْيِير (A transfer between vehicles.)  [to change (with the passage of time)] / رَفَضَ (To choose not to do something; refuse, forbear, refrain.)  [to decline]",
 "うつわ": "زِبْدِيَّة (container for food) / سُلْطَانِيَّة (container for food) / زُبْدِيَّة (container for food)  [bowl]\nمثال: いくら器だけを日本一にしても、中身が三流やったらな〜んの意味もないんちゃうの？\n→ The container may be the best in Japan, but if the contents are third class, then isn't it completely meaningless? / قُدْرَة, مَقْدِرَة (The quality or state of being able; capacity to do or of doing something; having) / مَوْهِبَة (A skill or competence in doing; mental power; talent; aptitude.)  [ability]\nمثال: 彼は将来国家の棟梁たるべき器だ。\n→ He has the capacity to be a future leader of the nation.",
